    "en": "Liu",
    "zh": "刘",
    "history": "The Liu surname has several legendary origins, the most prominent tracing back to Liu Lei, a legendary \"Keeper of Dragons\" during the Xia dynasty. The surname rose to widespread prominence through Liu Bang, who rose from peasant origins to found the Han dynasty around 206 BC. Reigning as Emperor Gaozu, he popularised the surname Liu further by conferring it on favoured subjects as a mark of imperial favour. As of 2019, Liu ranked as China's fourth most common surname, claimed by roughly 70 million people.",
    "historyZh": "刘姓有多个传说起源,其中最主要的可追溯至夏朝传说中的“御龙氏”刘累。此姓因刘邦而广为流传,刘邦出身贫寒,约于公元前206年建立汉朝。他即位为汉高祖后,又将刘姓赐予宠信的臣子,以示恩宠,使刘姓进一步普及。截至2019年,刘姓是中国第四大姓,约有七千万人使用此姓。",
    "famous": "Lucy Liu - Acclaimed American actress known internationally for roles in films such as Charlie's Angels and the television series Elementary.",
    "famousZh": "刘玉玲（Lucy Liu）- 著名美国女演员，以《霹雳娇娃》等电影及电视剧《基本演绎法》中的角色闻名国际。",
