    "history": "The surname Du can ultimately trace its roots back to Emperor Yao. Emperor Yao’s descendant, Liu Lei (刘累), was the Keeper of Dragons for King Kong Jia during the Xia Dynasty. Some of Liu Lei’s descendants, in turn, would be granted the region of Du in present-day Shaanxi province by King Cheng of Zhou. They would later adopt Du as their surname.",
