    "en": "Yang",
    "zh": "杨",
    "history": "The Yang surname originated in Hongnong County, in present-day Henan and Shaanxi provinces. During the Jin dynasty (678-677 BC), Duke Wu conquered the vassal state of Yang and appointed Shu Xiang to govern it. When Shu Xiang's descendants later faced persecution, his great-grandson Yang Dao fled to Hongnong and established the lineage there. An alternative account traces origins to Song dynasty Zhejiang, where a foster child changed his surname to Yang in honour of his caretaker.",
    "historyZh": "杨姓起源于弘农郡,位于今河南、陕西两省境内。晋国(公元前678年至前677年)时期,晋武公灭掉杨国,任命叔向治理该地。叔向的后代后来遭受迫害,其曾孙杨道逃往弘农,并在此建立家族。另一种说法则追溯至宋代浙江,当时一名养子为感念养父的恩情,改姓为杨。",
    "famous": "Michelle Yeoh (杨紫琼) - Malaysian-Chinese actress who achieved international acclaim through films such as Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon and Crazy Rich Asians, and is an Academy Award winner.",
    "famousZh": "杨紫琼（Michelle Yeoh）- 马来西亚华裔女演员，凭借《卧虎藏龙》《疯狂的亚洲富豪》等电影享誉国际，并曾荣获奥斯卡金像奖。",
