    "en": "Lin",
    "zh": "林",
    "history": "The Lin surname originated during the Shang dynasty when Prince Bi Gan's pregnant wife fled into a forest to escape King Zhou's wrath. After the prince's execution and the subsequent fall of the Shang dynasty, the new ruler honoured Bi Gan's loyalty by conferring the surname Lin upon his newborn son, born in hiding. The character 林 combines two \"wood\" radicals (木木), symbolising a forest. Lin ranks as the 18th most common surname in China and has spread widely through migration to Southeast Asia and beyond.",
    "historyZh": "林姓起源于商朝,王子比干的妻子已有身孕,为躲避纣王的迫害而逃入森林。比干被处死、商朝随后灭亡后,新君王为表彰比干的忠诚,将其在藏身处所生的新生儿赐姓为“林”。“林”字由两个“木”字(木木)组成,象征森林。林姓是中国第18大姓,因历代移民已广泛分布于东南亚及世界各地。",
    "famous": "JJ Lin - Singaporean singer, songwriter, record producer and actor, one of the most successful Mandopop artists of his generation.",
    "famousZh": "林俊杰（JJ Lin）- 新加坡籍歌手、词曲创作人、音乐制作人兼演员，是其所属世代最成功的华语流行音乐歌手之一。",
