    "history": "The surname Pan can trace its roots back to Ji Sun (季孙), a grandson of King Wen of Zhou. At the start of the Zhou Dynasty (1046 - 256 BC), King Wen granted his 15th son, Bi Gong Gao (毕公高), the state of Bi in present-day Shaanxi province. In turn, Bi Gong Gao granted the region of Pan to his son, Ji Sun. Ji Sun’s descendants who later adopt Pan as their surname.",
    "historyZh": "潘姓可追溯至季孙,周文王之孙。周朝(公元前1046年至前256年)初年,周文王将其第十五子毕公高封于今陕西省境内的毕国。毕公高随后又将潘地封给其子季孙。季孙的后代后来便以潘为姓。",
