    "en": "Hu",
    "zh": "胡",
    "history": "Shares a common ancestry with the surname Chen 陈. The Hu clan is believed to be descended of the legendary Emperor Shun. When Gui Man was bestowed the state of Chen by the King Wu of Zhou, some of his descendants adopted the surname \"Chen\" in honor of the newfound state. After his death, Gui Man was granted the posthumous name \"Hu Gong\", and another group of his descendants adopted \"Hu\" as their surname, in his honor.",
    "historyZh": "与陈姓同源。胡氏相传是传说中帝舜的后裔。周武王将陈国封给妫满,舜帝的后裔,其部分后代便以新封国“陈”为姓,以纪念此事。妫满去世后,被追谥为“胡公”,另一部分后代便以“胡”为姓,以纪念先祖。",
